  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/940057/description_fe5979cc-c1f3-47a7-adaa-762ee64cd1a0.png\" alt=\"TerraBlender 标志\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/940057/description_068d4cdb-a61e-494c-ab62-852b110bc296.png\" alt=\"Glitchfiend 标志\" width=\"165\" height=\"34\"> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://neoforged.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/940057/description_63e97901-df5b-4af4-984d-39e657891bee.png\" alt=\"NeoForge 标志\" width=\"164\" height=\"34\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/GyyzU6T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/940057/description_ff0dcc1b-7245-4198-bc63-df20caeb4e24.png\" alt=\"加入我们的 Discord\" width=\"212\" height=\"38\"></a></p>\n<h1>简介</h1>\n<hr>\n<h4>TerraBlender 是一款库模组，旨在以简单且兼容的方式，配合 Minecraft 全新的生物群系与地形系统添加自定义生物群系。</h4>\n<p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>开发者</h1>\n<hr>\n<h3>有关如何使用 TerraBlender API 的文档请参见 <a href=\"https://github.com/Glitchfiend/TerraBlender/wiki/Getting-started\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender 维基</a></h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>相关链接</h1>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/TheAdubbz\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Twitter 上关注我</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.paypal.com/donate/?business=AdubbzG@gmail.com&item_name=TerraBlender (from CurseForge.com)&cy_code=USD\" rel=\"nofollow\">通过 PayPal 捐赠</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Adubbz\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Patreon 上赞助我</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:1px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>其他加载器版本</h1>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge 版 TerraBlender</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版 TerraBlender</a></strong></li>\n</ul>",
